    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34664" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμφύ̄σ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
